{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳近期捲入備受關注的爭議事件，一份發佈於今年早些時候的做空報告再次受到外界關注。報告顯示，在當前風波爆發前約六個月，美國做空研究機構Culper Research就曾對黃仁勳與一名隨後被懷疑為中國間諜的企業高管之間的密切關係提出質疑。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585670.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.297761+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T22:52:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"883d9601d12705542c8a48cf77564cf1ad528524f9226f5e0e7e8a2ba1e1270e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}